// How each kind of target is aimed (`docs/rules/casting.md` sections 5 to
// 7): one row for each, named as `Targeting` names it.
//
//   anchor    what it is aimed about: its caster; a friend it reaches; the
//             foe aimed at, or the nearest ahead, among those it reaches;
//             itself, if any foe is reached. Unaimed: not resolved unless it
//             has a working of its own.
//   shape     whom it takes in about the anchor once its power is known:
//             the anchor; the anchor's group, living, of its side, however
//             far; a cone from the caster's eye toward it; a blast at it;
//             every body the caster reaches; the party and the monsters on
//             its side about it
//   against   whom the shape is against, from the caster's side
//   strays    where a blind caster's spell goes astray: nowhere; about
//             another body in the fight, picked at random
//             (`PickBackfireTarget`); about a spot scattered within its
//             reach (`ScatterSpellPointTarget`)
//   falls     the shape a backfire falls in about the caster, against
//   falls_on  (retail `PrepareSpellTarget`, `RedirectBackfiredSpellTarget`)
//   from      whom a backfire comes from and where a cast is let go: the
//             caster; the body aimed at; the leader of the group aimed at;
//             the spot it went off toward; the spot a blast goes off at,
//             which its missiles fly to
//   returns   what Eye for an Eye turns it back as (retail
//             `FinishSpellEffectTargets`): on its owner, from the body aimed
//             at; on its owner's group, from the group's leader; a blast, a
//             cone or every foe reached, from where it went off; or no one
{
    Caster: (anchor: Caster, shape: One, against: Foes, strays: Nowhere, falls: One, falls_on: Own, from: Caster, returns: NoOne),
    Ally: (anchor: Friend, shape: One, against: Foes, strays: Body, falls: One, falls_on: Own, from: Aimed, returns: NoOne),
    Party: (anchor: Caster, shape: Party, against: Own, strays: Nowhere, falls: Reached, falls_on: Fellows, from: Caster, returns: NoOne),
    Enemy: (anchor: Foe, shape: One, against: Foes, strays: Body, falls: One, falls_on: Own, from: Aimed, returns: Owner),
    EnemyGroup: (anchor: Foe, shape: Group, against: Everyone, strays: Body, falls: Group, falls_on: Own, from: Leader, returns: Group),
    Cone: (anchor: Foe, shape: Cone, against: Everyone, strays: Spot, falls: Reached, falls_on: Fellows, from: Spot, returns: Cone),
    Radius: (anchor: Foe, shape: Blast, against: Opponents, strays: Spot, falls: Blast, falls_on: Own, from: SpotToSpot, returns: Blast),
    AllEnemies: (anchor: AnyFoe, shape: Reached, against: Foes, strays: Nowhere, falls: Reached, falls_on: Fellows, from: Caster, returns: Reached),
    Point: (anchor: Unaimed, shape: One, against: Foes, strays: Nowhere, falls: One, falls_on: Own, from: Caster, returns: NoOne),
    Item: (anchor: Unaimed, shape: One, against: Foes, strays: Nowhere, falls: One, falls_on: Own, from: Caster, returns: NoOne),
    LockOrTrap: (anchor: Unaimed, shape: One, against: Foes, strays: Nowhere, falls: One, falls_on: Own, from: Caster, returns: NoOne),
}
